                 QUERY PLAN                  
---------------------------------------------
 Hash Join
   Hash Cond: ("<0000000028>".start = c.id)
   ->  Nested Loop
         ->  Seq Scan on n2 a
         ->  Subquery Scan on "<0000000028>"
               ->  Graph VLE on e1 [1..2]
                     ->  Result
   ->  Hash
         ->  Seq Scan on n1 c
(9 rows)

